===Etymology 2===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*ǵʰewd-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|founden}}, from {{der|en|fro|founder}} (Modern French: {{m|fr|fonder}}), from {{der|en|la|fundō|fundāre}}. Compare {{m|en|fund}}.

